  "exploratory_user": "Spearman correlation between I(v) and the fold's genuine changed-MFE fraction at matched norm (1 and 16 kcal/mol), across all 19 fold directions AND within the null group (8 random + 3 published = 11); the across-19 value mostly measures the gap between the groups",
